# Step 1: Feature name: log_SpMax_L
# Feature description: The natural logarithm of the SpMax_L (Leading eigenvalue from Laplace matrix)
# Usefulness: Taking the logarithm of this feature may help normalize the range and tackle heavy-tailed distributions, making it easier for the model to learn patterns in SpMax_L. Given that this feature has a wide range compared to other molecular descriptors, log transformation could help improve its signal.

